+/** \brief Reserved egress queue buffer segments.
+    Used by \ref GSW_QOS_QUEUE_BUFFER_RESERVE_CFG_SET and \ref GSW_QOS_QUEUE_BUFFER_RESERVE_CFG_GET. */
